    "detailed_description": "The story of this classic point &amp; click adventure game revolves around time travel. A mysterious package appears at the door of our hero, a private detective, with the sender's address missing. A new crazy case can begin. We need to get to the bottom of the mystery and, if there is time, perhaps save humanity, or at least a few beauties. In the game you will visit several time periods. Together we'll take a look at ancient Egypt, ancient Troy, or the German base where the latest aviation technology is being developed.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>36 interactive characters<br></li><li>45 game locations in different settings<br></li><li>outstanding and stylish graphic design<br></li><li>lots of game items<br></li><li>interesting detective plot<br></li><li>logical puzzle tasks<br></li><li>quality music and sound effects</li></ul>",
